il0|n|To put off; to defer; to procrastinate; to prolong the time of or before. ; To retard; to stop, detain, or hinder, for a time; to retard the motion, or time of arrival, of; as, the mail is delayed by a heavy fall of snow. ; To allay; to temper.	a:16r0,50,3~16r0,50,3	n:22cu,48,8~22cu,48,8
