jgy|n|A minute portion; one of the small parts; a particular; an item; -- used chiefly in the plural; as, the details of a scheme or transaction. ; A narrative which relates minute points; an account which dwells on particulars. ; The selection for a particular service of a person or a body of men; hence, the person or the body of men so selected. ; To relate in particulars; to particularize; to report minutely and distinctly; to enumerate; to specify; as, he detailed all the facts in due order. ; To tell off or appoint for a particular service, as an officer, a troop, or a squadron.	a:zw,44,5;16xy,39,7;rt0,37,6;xvm,36,9;1vhw,31,5;1b5y,16,4;1awf,11,7;1w1v,1,3~xvm,36,9;1awf,11,7;16xy,39,7;rt0,37,6;1vhw,31,5;zw,44,5;1b5y,16,4;1w1v,1,3	v:14ut,86,5~14ut,86,5	n:rt0,35,5~rt0,35,5	N:1jda,24,3~1jda,24,3
